---Contains Properties set for the reservation.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.AllocationResourceStatusSpecificSKUAllocation
---@field sourceInstanceTemplateId? string ID of the instance template used to populate reservation properties.
---@field utilizations? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringMap Per service utilization breakdown. The Key is the Google Cloud managed service name.

---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.AllocationSpecificSKUAllocationAllocatedInstancePropertiesReservedDisk
---@field diskSizeGb? string Specifies the size of the disk in base-2 GB.
---@field interface? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.AllocationSpecificSKUAllocationAllocatedInstancePropertiesReservedDiskInterfaceEnum|string Specifies the disk interface to use for attaching this disk, which is either SCSI or NVME. The default isSCSI. For performance characteristics of SCSI over NVMe, seeLocal SSD performance.

