---Properties of the SKU instances being reserved.
---Next ID: 10
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.AllocationSpecificSKUAllocationReservedInstanceProperties
---@field machineType? string Specifies type of machine (name only) which has fixed number of vCPUs and fixed amount of memory. This also includes specifying custom machine type following custom-NUMBER_OF_CPUS-AMOUNT_OF_MEMORY pattern.
---@field maintenanceInterval? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.AllocationSpecificSKUAllocationReservedInstancePropertiesMaintenanceIntervalEnum|string Specifies the frequency of planned maintenance events. The accepted values are: `PERIODIC`.
---@field locationHint? string An opaque location hint used to place the allocation close to other resources. This field is for use by internal tools that use the public API.
---@field maintenanceFreezeDurationHours? number Specifies the number of hours after reservation creation where instances using the reservation won't be scheduled for maintenance.
---@field guestAccelerators? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.AcceleratorConfigList Specifies accelerator type and count.
---@field minCpuPlatform? string Minimum cpu platform the reservation.
---@field localSsds? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.AllocationSpecificSKUAllocationAllocatedInstancePropertiesReservedDiskList Specifies amount of local ssd to reserve with each instance. The type of disk is local-ssd.

