---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.BackendBackendOrchestrationInfo
---@field resourceUri? string The URI of the resource or system that manages the backend.

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.BackendBalancingModeEnum "CONNECTION"|"CUSTOM_METRICS"|"IN_FLIGHT"|"RATE"|"UTILIZATION"

---Represents a Cloud Storage Bucket resource.
