---@field exposeHeaders? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Specifies the content for the Access-Control-Expose-Headers header.
---@field maxAge? number Specifies how long results of a preflight request can be cached in seconds. This field translates to the Access-Control-Max-Age header.
