---@field lastKnownGoodState? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.FutureReservationStatusLastKnownGoodState Output only. [Output Only] This field represents the future reservation before an amendment was requested. If the amendment is declined, the Future Reservation will be reverted to the last known good state. The last known good state is not set when updating a future reservation whose Procurement Status is DRAFTING.
