---@field storagePoolProvisionedCapacity? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.FutureReservationStoragePoolProvisionedCapacity Output only. Storage pool provisioned capacities for each SKU type.
---@field specificSkuProperties? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.FutureReservationStatusSpecificSKUProperties

