---InstanceGroupManagerResizeRequest represents a request to create
---a number of VMs: either immediately or by queuing the request for the
---specified time. This resize request is nested under InstanceGroupManager
---and the VMs created by this request are added to the owning
---InstanceGroupManager.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InstanceGroupManagerResizeRequest
---@field status? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InstanceGroupManagerResizeRequestStatus Output only. Status of the request.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InstanceGroupManagerResizeRequestStateEnum Output only. Current state of the request.
---@field region? string Output only. The URL of a region where the resize request is located. Populated only for regional resize requests.
---@field description? string An optional description of this resource.
---@field instances? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.PerInstanceConfigList The names of instances to be created by this resize request. The number of names specified determines the number of instances to create. The group's target size will be increased by this number. This field cannot be used together with 'resize_by'.
---@field requestedRunDuration? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.Duration Requested run duration for instances that will be created by this request. At the end of the run duration instance will be deleted.
---@field resizeBy? number The number of instances to be created by this resize request. The group's target size will be increased by this number. This field cannot be used together with 'instances'.
---@field selfLink? string Output only. The URL for this resize request. The server defines this URL.
---@field kind? string Output only. The resource type, which is alwayscompute#instanceGroupManagerResizeRequest for resize requests.
---@field creationTimestamp? string Output only. The creation timestamp for this resize request inRFC3339 text format.
---@field zone? string Output only. The URL of a zone where the resize request is located. Populated only for zonal resize requests.
---@field name? string The name of this resize request. The name must be 1-63 characters long, and comply withRFC1035.
---@field id? string Output only. A unique identifier for this resource type. The server generates this identifier.
---@field count? number This field is deprecated, please use resize_by instead. The count of instances to create as part of this resize request.
---@field selfLinkWithId? string Output only. Server-defined URL for this resource with the resource id.

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InstanceGroupManagerResizeRequestList gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InstanceGroupManagerResizeRequest[]

