---@field sourceInstantSnapshotGroupId? string Output only. [Output Only] The ID value of the source instant snapshot group this InstantSnapshot is part of. This value may be used to determine whether the InstantSnapshot was created as part of an InstantSnapshotGroup creation.
---@field id? string Output only. [Output Only] The unique identifier for the resource. This identifier is defined by the server.
---@field region? string Output only. [Output Only] URL of the region where the instant snapshot resides. You must specify this field as part of the HTTP request URL. It is not settable as a field in the request body.
---@field diskSizeGb? string Output only. [Output Only] Size of the source disk, specified in GB.
---@field architecture? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InstantSnapshotArchitectureEnum Output only. [Output Only] The architecture of the instant snapshot. Valid values are ARM64 or X86_64.
---@field labels? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringMap Labels to apply to this InstantSnapshot. These can be later modified by the setLabels method. Label values may be empty.
---@field selfLink? string Output only. [Output Only] Server-defined URL for the resource.

