---@field zones? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Zones used to explain this blocker in more detail. Format is "zone1" and/or "zone2". This will be set for some blockers (like MISSING_ZONE) but does not apply to others.
---@field metros? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Metros used to explain this blocker in more detail. These are three-letter lowercase strings like "iad". This will be set for some blockers (like NO_ATTACHMENTS_IN_METRO_AND_ZONE) but does not apply to others.
---@field blockerType? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InterconnectAttachmentGroupConfiguredAvailabilitySLAIntendedSlaBlockersBlockerTypeEnum|string
