---@field intendedCapabilityBlockers? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InterconnectGroupConfiguredTopologyCapabilityIntendedCapabilityBlockersList
---@field supportedSla? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InterconnectGroupConfiguredTopologyCapabilitySupportedSlaEnum|string

---[Output Only] Reasons why configuration.topologyCapability.sla differs
---from intent.topologyCapability. This list is empty if and only if those
---are the same.
