---@field zones? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Zones used to explain this blocker in more detail. Zone names are "zone1" and/or "zone2".
---@field documentationLink? string Output only. [Output Only] The url of Google Cloud public documentation explaining this requirement. This is set for every type of requirement.
---@field explanation? string Output only. [Output Only] A human-readable explanation of this requirement and why it's not met. This is set for every type of requirement.
---@field interconnects? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Interconnects used to explain this blocker in more detail.
---@field metros? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Metros used to explain this blocker in more detail. These are three-letter lowercase strings like "iad". A blocker like INCOMPATIBLE_METROS will specify the problematic metros in this field.
---@field blockerType? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InterconnectGroupConfiguredTopologyCapabilityIntendedCapabilityBlockersBlockerTypeEnum|string
---@field facilities? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Facilities used to explain this blocker in more detail. Like physicalStructure.metros.facilities.facility, this is a numeric string like "5467".

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.InterconnectGroupConfiguredTopologyCapabilityIntendedCapabilityBlockersBlockerTypeEnum "INCOMPATIBLE_METROS"|"NOT_AVAILABLE"|"NO_INTERCONNECTS"|"NO_INTERCONNECTS_IN_METRO_AND_ZONE"|"OTHER"|"UNSPECIFIED"

