---Represents a License resource.
---
---A License represents billing and aggregate usage data forpublic andmarketplace images.
--- *Caution* This resource is intended for
---use only by third-party partners who are creatingCloud Marketplace
---images.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.License
---@field name? string Name of the resource. The name must be 1-63 characters long and comply withRFC1035.
---@field incompatibleLicenses? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Specifies licenseCodes of licenses that are incompatible with this license. If a license is incompatible with this license, it cannot be attached to the same disk or image.
---@field params? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.LicenseParams Input only. Additional params passed with the request, but not persisted as part of resource payload.
---@field transferable? boolean If false, licenses will not be copied from the source resource when creating an image from a disk, disk from snapshot, or snapshot from disk.
---@field resourceRequirements? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.LicenseResourceRequirements [Input Only] Deprecated.
---@field kind? string Output only. [Output Only] Type of resource. Always compute#license for licenses.
---@field creationTimestamp? string Output only. [Output Only] Creation timestamp inRFC3339 text format.
---@field description? string An optional textual description of the resource; provided by the client when the resource is created.
---@field selfLink? string Output only. [Output Only] Server-defined URL for the resource.
---@field licenseCode? string [Output Only] The unique code used to attach this license to images, snapshots, and disks.
---@field selfLinkWithId? string Output only. [Output Only] Server-defined URL for this resource with the resource id.
---@field updateTimestamp? string Output only. [Output Only] Last update timestamp inRFC3339 text format.
---@field requiredCoattachedLicenses? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Specifies the set of permissible coattached licenseCodes of licenses that satisfy the coattachment requirement of this license. At least one license from the set must be attached to the same disk or image as this license.
---@field id? string [Output Only] The unique identifier for the resource. This identifier is defined by the server.
---@field allowedReplacementLicenses? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Specifies licenseCodes of licenses that can replace this license. Note: such replacements are allowed even if removable_from_disk is false.
---@field osLicense? boolean If true, indicates this is an OS license. Only one OS license can be attached to a disk or image at a time.
---@field multiTenantOnly? boolean If true, this license can only be used on VMs on multi tenant nodes.
---@field soleTenantOnly? boolean If true, this license can only be used on VMs on sole tenant nodes.
---@field removableFromDisk? boolean If true, this license can be removed from a disk's set of licenses, with no replacement license needed.
---@field minimumRetention? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.Duration If set, this license will be unable to be removed or replaced once attached to a disk until the minimum_retention period has passed.
---@field chargesUseFee? boolean [Output Only] Deprecated. This field no longer reflects whether a license charges a usage fee.
---@field appendableToDisk? boolean If true, this license can be appended to an existing disk's set of licenses.

