---@field allowInterconnect? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesAllowInterconnectEnum Specifies whether Cloud Interconnect creation is allowed.
---@field allowVpcFirewallRules? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesAllowVpcFirewallRulesEnum Specifies whether VPC firewall rules can be created under the network.
