---@field allowDefaultNicAttachment? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesAllowDefaultNicAttachmentEnum Specifies whether default NIC attachment is allowed.
---@field allowLoadBalancing? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesAllowLoadBalancingEnum Specifies whether cloud load balancing is allowed.
---@field allowAliasIpRanges? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesAllowAliasIpRangesEnum Specifies whether alias IP ranges (and secondary address ranges) are allowed.
---@field firewallPolicyTypes? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesFirewallPolicyTypesItemEnumList
---@field addressPurposes? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesAddressPurposesItemEnumList Specifies what address purposes are supported. If empty, all address purposes are supported.
---@field allowVpcPeering? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesAllowVpcPeeringEnum Specifies whether VPC peering is allowed.
---@field allowAutoModeSubnet? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkProfileNetworkFeaturesAllowAutoModeSubnetEnum Specifies whether auto mode subnet creation is allowed.
