---@field bgpInterRegionCost? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NetworkRoutingConfigBgpInterRegionCostEnum|string Allows to define a preferred approach for handling inter-region cost in the selection process when using the STANDARD BGP best path selection algorithm. Can be DEFAULT orADD_COST_TO_MED.
