---@field maintenanceInterval? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NodeGroupMaintenanceIntervalEnum Specifies the frequency of planned maintenance events. The accepted values are: `AS_NEEDED` and `RECURRENT`.
---@field description? string An optional description of this resource. Provide this property when you create the resource.
---@field name? string The name of the resource, provided by the client when initially creating the resource. The resource name must be 1-63 characters long, and comply withRFC1035. Specifically, the name must be 1-63 characters long and match the regular expression `[a-z]([-a-z0-9]*[a-z0-9])?` which means the first character must be a lowercase letter, and all following characters must be a dash, lowercase letter, or digit, except the last character, which cannot be a dash.
---@field zone? string Output only. [Output Only] The name of the zone where the node group resides, such as us-central1-a.
---@field kind? string Output only. [Output Only] The type of the resource. Alwayscompute#nodeGroup for node group.
---@field locationHint? string An opaque location hint used to place the Node close to other resources. This field is for use by internal tools that use the public API. The location hint here on the NodeGroup overrides any location_hint present in the NodeTemplate.
---@field autoscalingPolicy? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.NodeGroupAutoscalingPolicy Specifies how autoscaling should behave.
