---@field resumeTime? string Output only. The timestamp at which the Rollout was resumed.
---@field completionTime? string Output only. The timestamp at which the Rollout was completed.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutStateEnum Output only. The current state of the Rollout.
---@field currentWaveNumber? string Output only. The number of the currently running wave. Ex. 1
---@field etag? string Output only. etag of the Rollout Ex. abc1234
---@field name? string Name of the resource. Provided by the client when the resource is created. The name must be 1-63 characters long, and comply withRFC1035. Specifically, the name must be 1-63 characters long and match the regular expression `[a-z]([-a-z0-9]*[a-z0-9])?` which means the first character must be a lowercase letter, and all following characters must be a dash, lowercase letter, or digit, except the last character, which cannot be a dash.
---@field creationTimestamp? string Output only. [Output Only] Creation timestamp inRFC3339 text format.
---@field rolloutEntity? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutRolloutEntity Required. The resource being rolled out.
---@field selfLink? string Output only. [Output Only] Server-defined fully-qualified URL for this resource.
---@field waveDetails? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutWaveDetailsList Output only. Details about each wave of the rollout.
---@field id? string Output only. [Output Only] The unique identifier for the resource. This identifier is defined by the server.
---@field kind? string Output only. [Output Only] Type of the resource. Always compute#rollout for rollouts.
---@field cancellationTime? string Output only. The timestamp at which the Rollout was cancelled.

