---@field id? string Output only. [Output Only] The unique identifier for the resource. This identifier is defined by the server.
---@field locationScope? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanLocationScopeEnum The location scope of the rollout plan. If not specified, the location scope is considered as ZONAL.
---@field name? string Name of the resource. Provided by the client when the resource is created. The name must be 1-63 characters long, and comply withRFC1035. Specifically, the name must be 1-63 characters long and match the regular expression `[a-z]([-a-z0-9]*[a-z0-9])?` which means the first character must be a lowercase letter, and all following characters must be a dash, lowercase letter, or digit, except the last character, which cannot be a dash.

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanList gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlan[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanLocationScopeEnum "LOCATION_SCOPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"REGIONAL"|"ZONAL"

---A single wave in a rollout plan.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWave
---@field displayName? string Optional. The display name of this wave of the rollout plan.
---@field number? string Output only. The wave number.
