---@field selectors? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveSelectorList Required. The selectors for this wave. There is a logical AND between each selector defined in a wave, so a resource must satisfy the criteria of *all* the specified selectors to be in scope for the wave.

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveList gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWave[]

---Options to control the pace of orchestration of a wave. These options are
---required only if the resource being rolled out follows the Orchestrated
---pattern.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptions
---@field delays? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptionsDelayList Optional. Delays, if any, to be added between batches of projects. We allow multiple Delays to be specified, letting users set separate delays between batches of projects corresponding to different locations and batches of projects corresponding to the same location.
---@field maxConcurrentResourcesPerLocation? string Optional. Maximum number of resources to be orchestrated per location in parallel.
---@field maxConcurrentLocations? string Optional. Maximum number of locations to be orchestrated in parallel.

---Options to control the delay, if any, between batches of projects.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptionsDelay
---@field duration? string Optional. The duration of the delay, if any, to be added between batches of projects. A zero duration corresponds to no delay.
---@field type? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptionsDelayTypeEnum|string Optional. Controls whether the specified duration is to be added at the end of each batch, or if the total processing time for each batch will be padded if needed to meet the specified duration. Must be set to TYPE_UNSPECIFIED if no delay is to be added.
---@field delimiter? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptionsDelayDelimiterEnum|string Optional. Controls whether the delay should only be added between batches of projects corresponding to different locations, or also between batches of projects corresponding to the same location. Must be set to DELIMITER_UNSPECIFIED if no delay is to be added.

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptionsDelayDelimiterEnum "DELIMITER_BATCH"|"DELIMITER_LOCATION"|"DELIMITER_UNSPECIFIED"

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptionsDelayList gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptionsDelay[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveOrchestrationOptionsDelayTypeEnum "TYPE_MINIMUM"|"TYPE_OFFSET"|"TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"

