---@field includedProjects? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Optional. Format: "projects/{project_id}"
---@field includedFolders? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Optional. Format: "folders/{folder_id}"
---@field includedOrganizations? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Optional. Format: "organizations/{organization_id}"

---The validation to be performed before progressing to the next wave.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveValidation
---@field timeBasedValidationMetadata? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveValidationTimeBasedValidationMetadata Optional. Metadata required if type = "time".
---@field type? string Required. The type of the validation. If a type of validation is associated with a metadata object, the appropriate metadata field mapping to the validation type must be provided in the validation message. Possible values are in quotes below alongside an explanation: "manual": The system waits for an end-user approval API before progressing to the next wave. "time": The system waits for a user specified duration before progressing to the next wave. TimeBasedValidation must be provided.

---Metadata required if type = "time".
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RolloutPlanWaveValidationTimeBasedValidationMetadata
---@field waitDuration? string Optional. The duration that the system waits in between waves. This wait starts after all changes in the wave are rolled out.

