---@field match? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.Expr CEL expression evaluated against a route to determine if this term applies. When not set, the term applies to all routes.
---@field priority? number The evaluation priority for this term, which must be between 0 (inclusive) and 2^31 (exclusive), and unique within the list.

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RoutePolicyPolicyTermList gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RoutePolicyPolicyTerm[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.compute_beta.RoutePolicyTypeEnum "ROUTE_POLICY_TYPE_EXPORT"|"ROUTE_POLICY_TYPE_IMPORT"

