---@field interface? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.SavedAttachedDiskInterfaceEnum|string Specifies the disk interface to use for attaching this disk, which is either SCSI or NVME.
---@field diskEncryptionKey? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.CustomerEncryptionKey The encryption key for the disk.
---@field licenses? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList Output only. [Output Only] Any valid publicly visible licenses.
---@field boot? boolean Indicates that this is a boot disk. The virtual machine will use the first partition of the disk for its root filesystem.
---@field index? number Output only. Specifies zero-based index of the disk that is attached to the source instance.
---@field kind? string Output only. [Output Only] Type of the resource. Alwayscompute#attachedDisk for attached disks.
---@field type? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.SavedAttachedDiskTypeEnum|string Specifies the type of the attached disk, either SCRATCH orPERSISTENT.
---@field mode? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.SavedAttachedDiskModeEnum|string The mode in which this disk is attached to the source instance, eitherREAD_WRITE or READ_ONLY.
---@field diskSizeGb? string The size of the disk in base-2 GB.
---@field diskType? string Output only. [Output Only] URL of the disk type resource. For example:projects/project/zones/zone/diskTypes/pd-standard or pd-ssd
---@field source? string Specifies a URL of the disk attached to the source instance.
---@field storageBytes? string Output only. [Output Only] A size of the storage used by the disk's snapshot by this machine image.
---@field storageBytesStatus? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.SavedAttachedDiskStorageBytesStatusEnum|string Output only. [Output Only] An indicator whether storageBytes is in a stable state or it is being adjusted as a result of shared storage reallocation. This status can either be UPDATING, meaning the size of the snapshot is being updated, or UP_TO_DATE, meaning the size of the snapshot is up-to-date.
---@field autoDelete? boolean Specifies whether the disk will be auto-deleted when the instance is deleted (but not when the disk is detached from the instance).
---@field deviceName? string Specifies the name of the disk attached to the source instance.
---@field guestOsFeatures? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.GuestOsFeatureList A list of features to enable on the guest operating system. Applicable only for bootable images. Read Enabling guest operating system features to see a list of available options.

