---@field jsonCustomConfig? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.SecurityPolicyAdvancedOptionsConfigJsonCustomConfig Custom configuration to apply the JSON parsing. Only applicable when json_parsing is set to STANDARD.
---@field requestBodyInspectionSize? string The maximum request size chosen by the customer with Waf enabled. Values supported are "8KB", "16KB, "32KB", "48KB" and "64KB". Values are case insensitive.
---@field userIpRequestHeaders? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.StringList An optional list of case-insensitive request header names to use for resolving the callers client IP address.
