---@field instance string Name of the instance scoping this request.

---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.SendDiagnosticInterruptInstancesResponse

---An instance serial console output.
---@class gcp.unstable.compute_beta.SerialPortOutput
---@field selfLink? string Output only. [Output Only] Server-defined URL for this resource.
---@field kind? string Output only. [Output Only] Type of the resource. Alwayscompute#serialPortOutput for serial port output.
---@field next? string [Output Only] The position of the next byte of content, regardless of whether the content exists, following the output returned in the `contents` property. Use this value in the next request as the start parameter.
---@field contents? string [Output Only] The contents of the console output.
---@field start? string The starting byte position of the output that was returned. This should match the start parameter sent with the request. If the serial console output exceeds the size of the buffer (1 MB), older output is overwritten by newer content. The output start value will indicate the byte position of the output that was returned, which might be different than the `start` value that was specified in the request.

