---@field soleTenantOnly? boolean If true, this license can only be used on VMs on sole tenant nodes.
---@field removableFromDisk? boolean If true, this license can be removed from a disk's set of licenses, with no replacement license needed.
---@field minimumRetention? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.Duration If set, this license will be unable to be removed or replaced once attached to a disk until the minimum_retention period has passed.
---@field chargesUseFee? boolean [Output Only] Deprecated. This field no longer reflects whether a license charges a usage fee.
