---@field selfLink? string Output only. [Output Only] A server-defined fully-qualified URL for this resource.
---@field creationTimestamp? string Output only. [Output Only] The creation timestamp, formatted asRFC3339 text.
---@field physicalTopology? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.ReservationSlotPhysicalTopology Output only. [Output Only] The physical topology of the reservation slot.
---@field id? string Output only. [Output Only] The unique identifier for this resource. This identifier is defined by the server.
---@field name? string Output only. [Output Only] The name of the reservation slot.
