---@field endpoints? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.WireGroupEndpointMap A map that contains the logical endpoints of the wire group. Specify key-value pairs for the map as follows: - Key: an RFC1035 user-specified label. - Value: an Endpoint object.
---@field wireProperties? gcp.unstable.compute_beta.WireProperties Properties for all wires in the wire group.
---@field selfLink? string Output only. [Output Only] Server-defined URL for the resource.
